"聊聊":[{"text":"我想和Tom聊聊。","en":"I would like to talk to Tom.","source":"tatoeba","id":3701750,"enId":7770330,"by":"egg0073"},{"text":"我想和汤姆私下聊聊。","en":"I'd like to speak with Tom in private.","source":"tatoeba","id":13897754,"enId":1936354,"by":"jan_OkulaJu"},{"text":"其他人正在离开呢，要不要等他们走完了我们聊聊？","en":"The others are leaving. What do you say we wait for them to go away and talk for a while?","source":"tatoeba","id":4512811,"enId":4757666,"by":"yuiyu"},{"text":"我们也可以好好聊聊","source":"aishell3","id":"SSB04340308"},{"text":"我想和大家聊聊","source":"aishell3","id":"SSB18780206"}],
